n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Quinta das Arcas 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Trail Quinta das Arcas 2026 realiza-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, com partidas e chegadas nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Quinta das Arcas (Rua Central da Lomba, coordenadas 41\u00b012&#8217;03.8&#8243;N 8\u00b027&#8217;16.0&#8243;W), na freguesia de Sobrado, concelho de Valongo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, hor\u00e1rios de partida e vagas dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disp\u00f5e de 2000 vagas distribu\u00eddas por tr\u00eas provas: Trail de 20 km (partida \u00e0s 09:00, controlo zero \u00e0s 08:45, 500 vagas, maiores de 18 anos), Mini Trail de 12 km (partida \u00e0s 09:30, controlo zero \u00e0s 09:10, 750 vagas, maiores de 16 anos) e Caminhada de 12 km n\u00e3o competitiva (partida \u00e0s 09:30, 750 vagas).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (1 de julho a 24 de outubro), os pre\u00e7os s\u00e3o de 17,50 \u20ac (Trail 20 km), 15,00 \u20ac (Mini Trail 12 km) e 12,50 \u20ac (Caminhada). Na 2\u00aa fase (25 de outubro a 21 de novembro), os valores passam para 20,00 \u20ac (Trail), 17,50 \u20ac (Mini Trail) e 15,00 \u20ac (Caminhada). Em inscri\u00e7\u00f5es de \u00faltima hora acresce 2,50 \u20ac, e a cada 10 inscri\u00e7\u00f5es de equipa \u00e9 oferecida a 11\u00aa em voucher.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona nas instala\u00e7\u00f5es da Quinta das Arcas, em Sobrado, no s\u00e1bado (28 de novembro) das 10:00 \u00e0s 12:30 e das 14:00 \u00e0s 18:00, e no domingo (29 de novembro, dia da prova) das 07:00 \u00e0s 08:15.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite m\u00e1ximo \u00e9 de 4h00, existindo um barramento hor\u00e1rio \u00e0s 11:15 no \u00faltimo posto de controlo\/abastecimento. Todos os participantes (Trail, Mini Trail e Caminhada) devem transportar obrigatoriamente telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, manta t\u00e9rmica, dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua e copo pr\u00f3prio, visto que n\u00e3o s\u00e3o fornecidos copos nos abastecimentos.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Quinta das Arcas 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Quinta das Arcas, Rua Central da Lomba, Sobrado\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Valongo\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Quinta das Arcas 2026 realiza-se a 29 de novembro em Sobrado, Valongo. Provas de Trail 20 km, Mini Trail 12 km e Caminhada. Garante j\u00e1 o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-quinta-das-arcas-1.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail 20 km\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_quinta_arcas_2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini Trail 12 km\", \"price\": \"17.50\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_quinta_arcas_2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 12 km\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.portimer.pt\/eventos\/trail_quinta_arcas_2026\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Candibyke \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Ciclismo\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Q